From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 03:32:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msi: MsiGetLastErrorRecord, MsiPreviewBillboard and Billboard
 control, MsiRemovePatches (3217)

MsiGetLastErrorRecord keeps a per-process error record set by the database
functions the documentation lists (2203/2219/2204/2214/2215/2228/2232/2235/
2246/2268, messages from the Windows Installer error table). The Billboard
control shows the Billboard/BBControl rows (MsiPreviewBillboard and the
SetProgress event). MsiRemovePatches reinstalls the product without the
patches and unregisters them.

CORE review: behaviour change, see patches/notes/3217.txt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

